  "description": "The sudden death of the Beomseo Group's boss has left Song Tae-Ha at the top of the food chain, but the view from the throne is blood-stained. When he crosses paths with his former rival, Tak Heedo, he finds a man shattered and unrecognizable from the fierce competitor he once knew. Stirred by a dark, inexplicable impulse, Tae-Ha offers Hee-Do a humiliating lifeline. If Hee-Do wants out of the gutter, he’ll have to get on his knees and serve the man who took everything from him. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
